# APKs live in GitHub Releases, not in the repo.
#
# Each build is ~58 MB, and git keeps every one of them forever: by v1.0.16 the
# history alone had grown past 700 MB, and GitHub was warning on every push that
# the file exceeded its 50 MB guideline. Releases carry the same file with no
# such cost, and version.json already points at a URL — so the in-app updater
# does not care where it lives.
apk/
*.apk
